at the same time she feels the need to oppose her sisters. It's frustrating that she can't do anything by herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In reality, she doesn't detest her sisters' actions as much as she lets on. It just happens that sometimes she gets brash with her wording. One could say it's the other side of her feelings for her family and the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's also the fledging VTuber Hinoki Yui."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91970"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/673acb25c25c8bdef4914b26eb0e4c5dbc2888ae0b00269c143883b5f434cb55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08faab9955ddd2d7313f470432a2ad50f7e7d9836ed0bcd212cb291aadec1142.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"塩小路 もろみ","creatorId":"vndb:s15235","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15235","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15235","name":"塩小路 もろみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85371","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91971","characterName":"速水 静乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c91971"},"originalCharacterName":"速水 静乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1127"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState